<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg up on MBT takeover plans.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg up on MBT takeover plans.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German specialty chemical group SKW Trostberg AG were higher in bourse trade on Monday after the speciality chemicals group said it would buy Master Builders Technology (MBT) from Swiss group Sandoz AG.</p>
<p>The SKW Trostberg share was given a further boost after it said it was planning to seek outside financing and was not considering a capital rise to fund the MBT purchase.</p>
<p>At 0921 GMT SKW Trostberg shares were up 1.45 marks at 39.50 marks, a gain of 3.81 percent. The overall market was down 3.58 points at 2,551.58 points, a drop of 0.14 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
